Subject: [selfhost 003] `&self.invocation()` is the pointer itself now

ref_returns made CompilerInvocation& invocation() return the pointer, so the
Stage 0 address-of on its result is an address of an rvalue; ref_returns
reports these sites rather than dropping the `&` (a dropped `&` would read
as a value use, and get a `*`, on the idempotency rerun).

